135-168626-0000 V:0.4177 A:0.2846 D:0.4210 THE LITTLE ONE ALL ALONE AS THE THENARDIER HOSTELRY WAS IN THAT PART OF THE VILLAGE WHICH IS NEAR THE CHURCH IT WAS TO THE SPRING IN THE FOREST IN THE DIRECTION OF CHELLES THAT COSETTE WAS OBLIGED TO GO FOR HER WATER
135-168626-0001 V:0.4545 A:0.3540 D:0.4957 SHE MADE AS MUCH MOTION AS POSSIBLE WITH THE HANDLE OF THE BUCKET AS SHE WALKED ALONG
135-168626-0002 V:0.3934 A:0.2487 D:0.4040 THIS MADE A NOISE WHICH AFFORDED HER COMPANY
135-168626-0003 V:0.3409 A:0.3045 D:0.4438 THE FURTHER SHE WENT THE DENSER THE DARKNESS BECAME
135-168626-0004 V:0.1977 A:0.2630 D:0.4169 THERE WAS NO ONE IN THE STREETS
