135-168626-0008 V:0.4320 A:0.3333 D:0.4812 SO LONG AS SHE HAD THE HOUSES OR EVEN THE WALLS ONLY ON BOTH SIDES OF HER PATH SHE PROCEEDED WITH TOLERABLE BOLDNESS
135-168626-0009 V:0.4337 A:0.2703 D:0.4231 FROM TIME TO TIME SHE CAUGHT THE FLICKER OF A CANDLE THROUGH THE CRACK OF A SHUTTER THIS WAS LIGHT AND LIFE THERE WERE PEOPLE THERE AND IT REASSURED HER
135-168626-0010 V:0.4165 A:0.3208 D:0.4257 BUT IN PROPORTION AS SHE ADVANCED HER PACE SLACKENED MECHANICALLY AS IT WERE
135-168626-0011 V:0.3587 A:0.2740 D:0.4130 WHEN SHE HAD PASSED THE CORNER OF THE LAST HOUSE COSETTE PAUSED
135-168626-0012 V:0.3808 A:0.2995 D:0.4357 IT HAD BEEN HARD TO ADVANCE FURTHER THAN THE LAST STALL IT BECAME IMPOSSIBLE TO PROCEED FURTHER THAN THE LAST HOUSE
135-168626-0013 V:0.2651 A:0.3162 D:0.4468 SHE SET HER BUCKET ON THE GROUND THRUST HER HAND INTO HER HAIR AND BEGAN SLOWLY TO SCRATCH HER HEAD A GESTURE PECULIAR TO CHILDREN WHEN TERRIFIED AND UNDECIDED WHAT TO DO
135-168626-0014 V:0.3942 A:0.3097 D:0.4362 IT WAS THE OPEN FIELDS
