135-168626-0016 V:0.2516 A:0.2255 D:0.3756 SHE GAZED IN DESPAIR AT THAT DARKNESS WHERE THERE WAS NO LONGER ANY ONE WHERE THERE WERE BEASTS WHERE THERE WERE SPECTRES POSSIBLY
135-168626-0017 V:0.5361 A:0.3507 D:0.4841 SHE TOOK A GOOD LOOK AND HEARD THE BEASTS WALKING ON THE GRASS AND SHE DISTINCTLY SAW SPECTRES MOVING IN THE TREES
135-168626-0018 V:0.2397 A:0.3432 D:0.4953 THEN SHE SEIZED HER BUCKET AGAIN FEAR HAD LENT HER AUDACITY
