135-168626-0025 V:0.2510 A:0.1952 D:0.3246 WHAT WAS TO BECOME OF HER
135-168626-0026 V:0.2691 A:0.4611 D:0.5207 WHERE WAS SHE TO GO
135-168626-0027 V:0.3962 A:0.2537 D:0.4079 IN FRONT OF HER WAS THE SPECTRE OF THE THENARDIER
135-168626-0028 V:0.3573 A:0.3023 D:0.4359 SHE ENTERED THE FOREST AT A RUN NO LONGER LOOKING AT OR LISTENING TO ANYTHING
135-168626-0029 V:0.3438 A:0.2892 D:0.4299 SHE ONLY PAUSED IN HER COURSE WHEN HER BREATH FAILED HER BUT SHE DID NOT HALT IN HER ADVANCE
135-168626-0030 V:0.2235 A:0.2604 D:0.4294 SHE WENT STRAIGHT BEFORE HER IN DESPERATION
135-168626-0031 V:0.2527 A:0.2520 D:0.3812 AS SHE RAN SHE FELT LIKE CRYING
135-168626-0032 V:0.4504 A:0.3123 D:0.4650 THE NOCTURNAL QUIVERING OF THE FOREST SURROUNDED HER COMPLETELY
135-168626-0033 V:0.2830 A:0.2078 D:0.3676 SHE NO LONGER THOUGHT SHE NO LONGER SAW
135-168626-0034 V:0.5384 A:0.3668 D:0.4916 THE IMMENSITY OF NIGHT WAS FACING THIS TINY CREATURE
135-168626-0035 V:0.4255 A:0.2720 D:0.3973 ON THE ONE HAND ALL SHADOW ON THE OTHER AN ATOM
135-168626-0036 V:0.3646 A:0.3139 D:0.4327 IT WAS ONLY SEVEN OR EIGHT MINUTES WALK FROM THE EDGE OF THE WOODS TO THE SPRING
135-168626-0037 V:0.3951 A:0.2738 D:0.4197 COSETTE KNEW THE WAY THROUGH HAVING GONE OVER IT MANY TIMES IN DAYLIGHT
135-168626-0038 V:0.2776 A:0.3042 D:0.4515 STRANGE TO SAY SHE DID NOT GET LOST
135-168626-0039 V:0.4648 A:0.2731 D:0.4139 A REMNANT OF INSTINCT GUIDED HER VAGUELY
135-168626-0040 V:0.4189 A:0.3432 D:0.4623 BUT SHE DID NOT TURN HER EYES EITHER TO RIGHT OR TO LEFT FOR FEAR OF SEEING THINGS IN THE BRANCHES AND IN THE BRUSHWOOD
135-168626-0041 V:0.4449 A:0.2128 D:0.3709 IN THIS MANNER SHE REACHED THE SPRING
135-168626-0042 V:0.4615 A:0.3007 D:0.4434 IT WAS A NARROW NATURAL BASIN HOLLOWED OUT BY THE WATER IN A CLAYEY SOIL ABOUT TWO FEET DEEP AND PAVED WITH SEVERAL LARGE STONES
135-168626-0043 V:0.3304 A:0.2049 D:0.3519 A BROOK RAN OUT OF IT WITH A TRANQUIL LITTLE NOISE
135-168626-0044 V:0.2575 A:0.2887 D:0.4346 COSETTE DID NOT TAKE TIME TO BREATHE
135-168626-0045 V:0.3463 A:0.2711 D:0.4109 IT WAS VERY DARK BUT SHE WAS IN THE HABIT OF COMING TO THIS SPRING
135-168626-0047 V:0.3052 A:0.4139 D:0.5394 SHE WAS IN A STATE OF SUCH VIOLENT EXCITEMENT THAT HER STRENGTH WAS TREBLED
135-168626-0048 V:0.3272 A:0.2390 D:0.3775 WHILE THUS BENT OVER SHE DID NOT NOTICE THAT THE POCKET OF HER APRON HAD EMPTIED ITSELF INTO THE SPRING
