135-168626-0050 V:0.4170 A:0.2384 D:0.4102 SHE DREW OUT THE BUCKET NEARLY FULL AND SET IT ON THE GRASS
135-168626-0051 V:0.2680 A:0.3383 D:0.4723 THAT DONE SHE PERCEIVED THAT SHE WAS WORN OUT WITH FATIGUE
135-168626-0052 V:0.3826 A:0.3622 D:0.4974 SHE WOULD HAVE LIKED TO SET OUT AGAIN AT ONCE BUT THE EFFORT REQUIRED TO FILL THE BUCKET HAD BEEN SUCH THAT SHE FOUND IT IMPOSSIBLE TO TAKE A STEP
