135-168626-0056 V:0.3588 A:0.2864 D:0.4205 THE AGITATED WATER IN THE BUCKET BESIDE HER WAS DESCRIBING CIRCLES WHICH RESEMBLED TIN SERPENTS
135-168626-0057 V:0.3737 A:0.2811 D:0.3996 OVERHEAD THE SKY WAS COVERED WITH VAST BLACK CLOUDS WHICH WERE LIKE MASSES OF SMOKE
