135-168626-0059 V:0.4883 A:0.3010 D:0.4530 JUPITER WAS SETTING IN THE DEPTHS
135-168626-0060 V:0.3422 A:0.3110 D:0.4297 THE CHILD STARED WITH BEWILDERED EYES AT THIS GREAT STAR WITH WHICH SHE WAS UNFAMILIAR AND WHICH TERRIFIED HER
135-168626-0061 V:0.3869 A:0.2974 D:0.4352 THE PLANET WAS IN FACT VERY NEAR THE HORIZON AND WAS TRAVERSING A DENSE LAYER OF MIST WHICH IMPARTED TO IT A HORRIBLE RUDDY HUE
135-168626-0062 V:0.4140 A:0.2844 D:0.4330 THE MIST GLOOMILY EMPURPLED MAGNIFIED THE STAR
