135-168626-0067 V:0.4408 A:0.3197 D:0.4654 SLENDER AND MISSHAPEN BUSHES WHISTLED IN THE CLEARINGS
135-168626-0068 V:0.4837 A:0.3276 D:0.4452 THE TALL GRASSES UNDULATED LIKE EELS UNDER THE NORTH WIND
