135-168626-0095 V:0.3761 A:0.2612 D:0.4125 THIS TOOK PLACE IN THE DEPTHS OF A FOREST AT NIGHT IN WINTER FAR FROM ALL HUMAN SIGHT SHE WAS A CHILD OF EIGHT
