84-363-0058 V:0.4503 A:0.2553 D:0.4099 NIGHT WAS FAR ADVANCED WHEN I CAME TO THE HALFWAY RESTING PLACE AND SEATED MYSELF BESIDE THE FOUNTAIN
84-363-0059 V:0.4141 A:0.1499 D:0.3084 THE STARS SHONE AT INTERVALS AS THE CLOUDS PASSED FROM OVER THEM THE DARK PINES ROSE BEFORE ME AND EVERY HERE AND THERE A BROKEN TREE LAY ON THE GROUND IT WAS A SCENE OF WONDERFUL SOLEMNITY AND STIRRED STRANGE THOUGHTS WITHIN ME
84-363-0060 V:0.1428 A:0.2090 D:0.3381 I WEPT BITTERLY AND CLASPING MY HANDS IN AGONY I EXCLAIMED OH
